          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can hair loss be reversed?",
            "answer": "<p>Sometimes, and it depends entirely on the cause. Hair loss from stress, illness, diet, hormones or damage often responds well to treatment. Scarring hair loss will not regrow, but it can be slowed. This is exactly what a consultation is for.</p>"
